Error [E0621]: top-level executable statements require an explicit `fn run`
  --> tests/ui/script_explicit_run.jet:1:1
    |
  1 | print("before")
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Jet does not invent a runtime function for ordinary files; only `fn run` executes code
 Fix: move the statements into `fn run`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0621
